# executor (Node 26 네이티브 TS, 빌드 스텝 없음). 빌드 컨텍스트 = 레포 루트.
FROM node:26-slim
WORKDIR /app
COPY package.json package-lock.json ./
RUN npm ci --omit=dev
COPY executor ./executor
COPY seller/config ./seller/config
COPY scripts ./scripts
COPY policy/rulesets ./policy/rulesets
COPY shared ./shared
ENV AUDIT_PATH=/tmp/audit.jsonl STATE_PATH=/tmp/envelope-state.json
CMD ["node", "executor/server.ts"]
